(every feature without picking a file.) '
() '
(Long press any word to start a text selection. Drag the handles to extend it.) '
(In vertical mode you can drag a handle past the bottom of a page and the) '
(selection continues on the next page, so a single highlight can span several) '
(pages.) '
() '
(Once a selection is active, use the floating menu to copy the text or to) '
(highlight it with one of the available colors. Highlights are persisted) '
(through the PdfViewerStorage interface. This minimal sample uses the default) '
(Room implementation shipped with the SDK, so nothing has to be configured by) '
(the host app.) '
() '
(Bookmarks, page notes and the last read page are stored the same way. Close) '
(this screen and open it again: the viewer reopens on the page where you left) '
(it and every annotation is restored.) '
() '
(Use the search button to find text across the whole document, the thumbnail) '
(drawer to jump between pages, and the orientation toggle to switch between) '
(horizontal paging and continuous vertical scrolling.) '
